        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Length of purple silk with fine yellow border and a single band at one end."@en , "Purple silk length, Agra, ca. 1855."@en , "Lengths of silk such as this are categorised as 'piece goods', fabrics  made to standard dimensions for sale. Piece goods could be used for a  variety of purposes. Silk such as this length was often used to make or  line garments."@en ;
